      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/4134-wire-control-offset\n\nConflicts resolved by hand, keeping both sides:\n- Test literals of WireContourOp (model_arcs.rs, sodick_aq600l.rs,\n  wire_verify.rs): keep compensation (#4134) and overlap (#3216).\n- camcraft-mcp SKILL.md: main's Wire Contour row (centre side, overlap)\n  plus this PR's compensation field and paragraph.\n\nMerge fixes (no textual conflict):\n- comp.rs: main's WireSide::Centre is an open run; the span builder\n  refuses it with Left and Right (the match was not exhaustive).\n- comp_tests.rs: WireParams takes main's overlap field.\n- New pin the_closing_overlap_is_programmed_on_the_part_contour_under_the_offset:\n  a 2 mm overlap under control compensation posts on the part contour\n  past the seam, with G40 on the lead-out.\n\nRefs #4134\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
